            <ArticleTitle>Symptomatic solitary giant congenital cysts of liver.</ArticleTitle>
            <Pagination>
                <MedlinePgn>136-8</MedlinePgn>
            </Pagination>
            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>Three cases of non-parasitic liver cysts are reported. Each of them presented with upper abdominal pain and enlarged liver, and a cyst of enormous size was detected by ultrasound and isotopic scan. Residual cavity following cyst surgery was obliterated by different surgical techniques.</AbstractText>
            </Abstract>
